{"title":"Acacia Burl","slug":"Acacia_Burl","hero":{"file":"Acacia_burl.webp","width":310,"height":514},"pageid":4413,"revid":20344,"timestamp":"2025-11-05T01:18:08Z","lastEditor":"Reererere","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Burl","fields":[{"label":"$/burl","value":"$664"},{"label":"$/sanded","value":"$3322"}]},"sections":[],"body":"<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: An acacia burl on a tree\">An acacia burl on a tree</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Acacia_burl.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>An acacia burl on a tree</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Burls/\">Burls</a> are a sub-resource of trees. <b>Acacia Burls</b> partially - rarely spawn on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Acacia/\">Acacia Trees</a> on the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater</a> island, <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Acacia/\">acacia</a> burls</b> usually spawn on the base of larger acacia trees<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\"><span><span>&#91;</span>1<span>&#93;</span></span></sup>. Finding an acacia burl isn't considered rare, as they are quite common in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater</a> island.\n</p>\n\n<div><ol>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span><span>↑</span></span> <span>Acacia tree burls never spawn on skinny trees, only ever spawning on the thicker, larger trees.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>"}
